{"cti_reasoning":"State tokens=4'd7, free=4'd5 satisfies P (guard free!=0 holds and tokens<=7) but violates R (7+5=12 != 8); with ce low the design sits here forever, and one step with ce=1, drip=1, req=0 drips a token because free!=0, giving tokens=4'd8 and free=4'd4, so the guard still holds while tokens>7 and P fails.","cti_state":[{"signal":"tokens","value":"4'd7"},{"signal":"free","value":"4'd5"}],"invariants":["tokens + free == 4'd8"],"verilog":"module token_bucket (
