{"cti_reasoning":"In state S the dispense flag is low, so P is vacuously true, but the cent accumulator disagrees with the unit accumulator (cents=40 while 5*units=20), violating R. With i_ce low the machine sits in S forever; one insert of a dime then makes new_units=6>=5, so it dispenses with change = (40+10)-25 = 25, setting dispense=1 and change=6'd25, which breaks the bound P.","cti_state":[{"signal":"units","value":"4'd4"},{"signal":"cents","value":"6'd40"},{"signal":"dispense","value":"1'b0"},{"signal":"change","value":"6'd0"}],"invariants":["cents == units * 5","units <= 4"],"verilog":"module vend_credit (
