{"cti_reasoning": "The state S has the request FSM sitting in RUN (a transfer in flight) while the sticky chain bits seen_arm/seen_start are still 0, so the guarded property is vacuously true (seen_fin==0) but the structural relation "RUN implies seen_start" is false; holding i_ce low keeps the design frozen in S for any number of cycles, and one step with i_ce=1, i_finish=1 fires fin_pulse, setting seen_fin=1 while seen_start stays 0, so the next state violates P.", "cti_state": [{"signal": "state", "value": "2'd2"}, {"signal": "tokens", "value": "3'd2"}, {"signal": "seen_arm", "value": "1'b0"}, {"signal": "seen_start", "value": "1'b0"}, {"signal": "seen_fin", "value": "1'b0"}], "invariants": ["state != 2'd3", "tokens <= 3'd4", "(state == 2'd0) || seen_arm", "(state != 2'd2) || seen_start"], "verilog": "module token_chain (
